## Strategic Council Rules (C03)

| Rule | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| **Financial Truth First** | audit · posting · tables · who/when/why |
| **No expansion before trust** | no fake KPI/AI without data |
| **No intelligence before data** | rules-based UI before LLM |
| **No features before money integrity** | posting/audit before cosmetic modules |

**UI = financial operating system** — not landing page · not marketing dashboard.

---

## Non-Negotiables (WPF)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Resources | `UiResources` / `FindResource` — **never** `Resources["Key"]` on UserControl |
| Strings | `LocaleManager.T(ar, en)` for every visible string |
| Theme | `BrqoshTheme.xaml` — unified palette/radius/elevation |
| Icons | Monogram nav/KPI badges — **no emoji** |
| Numbers | tabular financial figures · DataGrid row ~44px |
| Test | dark (`ThemeManager`) + AR/EN (`LocaleManager`) |

---

## Tokens & ERP Density

```
Density: HIGH — accountant works 8 hours/day
Type: clear · tabular numbers · correct RTL alignment
Color: BrqoshTheme only — no random hex in XAML
Spacing: theme system — no scattered manual margins
Empty: unified EmptyState — no blank white screens
```

**Token ref:** `.cursor/skills/brqosh-ui-design-system/tokens.md`

---

## RTL & Financial Alignment

```
✓ FlowDirection from LocaleManager/theme — not hardcoded LTR
✓ amounts: right-aligned in AR · tabular figures
✓ debit/credit columns consistent across screens
✓ DatePicker/ComboBox work in AR and EN
✗ mixed directions in same row
✗ hardcoded English in Arabic-facing UI
```

---

## 8-Axis UI Review (before closure)

| # | Axis | Verify |
|---|------|--------|
| 1 | Truth | real data — no fake placeholders presented as live |
| 2 | RBAC | buttons per permission · `BindSecurityContext` |
| 3 | RTL | AR + EN · FlowDirection · tabular |
| 4 | Theme | BrqoshTheme keys · dark mode |
| 5 | Density | DataGrid 44px · no wasted space |
| 6 | Empty | EmptyState when no data |
| 7 | A11y | contrast · keyboard · focus |
| 8 | Tests | Desktop.Tests static · audit script |

**Priority:** Truth > RBAC > RTL > rest

---

## UI Decision Tree

```
Screen change
├─ touches posting/amounts/entries? → C06 first — no cosmetic masking financial errors
├─ new screen? → spec in design-system/pages/ first
├─ KPI/AI/dashboard? → data ready? NO → ⏭ or honest empty state
├─ global theme change? → Themes/ only — no local override
└─ after substantive change → ui-ux-pro-max-audit.ps1
```

---

## Empty State (mandatory)

Every empty list/grid requires:
- clear AR/EN message via `LocaleManager.T`
- next action (create/import button) when logical
- **never** display mock data as real

---

## Agent Forbidden Patterns

| Forbidden | Replace with |
|-----------|--------------|
| hero sections · marketing gradients | dense operational tables |
| emoji in ERP | monogram |
| random KPI widgets | service data or empty state |
| `Resources["Key"]` | `FindResource` |
| hardcoded strings | `LocaleManager.T` |
| close UI without AR+EN+dark | test all three |

